{{!-- The landing (home.hbs), from the Ghost page "inicio". First screen: the
    logo (the page title stays for search engines and screen readers), the
    site's meta title as headline, then the page's opening line, which
    landing.js moves up from the text - it ends in "preguntas:", so the
    questions follow it. Then the questions, what members say, and last the
    three ways in on a grey band (landing.js moves it after the voices). --}}
{{#get "pages" filter="slug:inicio" limit="1"}}
{{#foreach pages}}
<section class="gh-landing-hero gh-landing-snap">
    <div class="gh-landing-inner">
        <h1 class="gh-visually-hidden">{{title}}</h1>
        {{!-- The site's meta title (Settings → General → Metadata), the line
            search engines show; the description when there is none. --}}
        {{#if @site.meta_title}}<p class="gh-landing-eyebrow">{{@site.meta_title}}</p>{{else}}{{#if @site.description}}<p class="gh-landing-eyebrow">{{@site.description}}</p>{{/if}}{{/if}}
        <span class="gh-landing-logo" aria-hidden="true">
            {{#if @site.logo}}
            <img class="logo-nav logo-light" src="{{@site.logo}}" alt="">
            <img class="logo-nav logo-dark" src="{{#if @custom.dark_logo}}{{@custom.dark_logo}}{{else}}{{@site.logo}}{{/if}}" alt="">
            {{> "logo-stacked"}}
            {{else}}
            {{@site.title}}
            {{/if}}
        </span>
        <div class="gh-landing-intro"></div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="gh-landing-text gh-landing-snap" id="gh-landing-text">
    <div class="gh-content gh-landing-inner">
        {{content}}
    </div>
    <nav class="gh-landing-paths gh-landing-inner" aria-label="{{t "Choose your path"}}">
        <a class="gh-landing-path" href="{{@site.url}}/blog/">
            {{> "icons/phosphor/notebook"}}
            <span class="gh-landing-path-name">{{t "Blog"}} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
            <span class="gh-landing-path-text">{{t "Articles to understand crypto and trading"}}</span>
        </a>
        <a class="gh-landing-path" href="{{@site.url}}/curso/">
            {{> "icons/phosphor/student"}}
            <span class="gh-landing-path-name">{{t "Course"}} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
            <span class="gh-landing-path-text">{{t "The path, step by step"}}</span>
        </a>
        <a class="gh-landing-path" href="{{@site.url}}/comunidad/">
            {{> "icons/phosphor/globe-hemisphere-west"}}
            <span class="gh-landing-path-name">{{t "Community"}} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
            <span class="gh-landing-path-text">{{t "Where we trade and keep each other going"}}</span>
        </a>
    </nav>
</section>
{{/foreach}}
{{/get}}

{{!-- What members say: forum posts by members (comunidad.criptonautas.co),
    trimmed to a few lines, spelling fixed, "…" where a quote is cut;
    landing.js lays them out in two drifting rows. Forum username and avatar
    only: the nauta/trader/nuevo tag comes back with the tiers. shortcut: written here; they move to an editable source when
    the quotes from the other base arrive. --}}
<section class="gh-landing-voices gh-landing-snap" aria-labelledby="gh-landing-voices-title">
    <div class="gh-landing-inner">
        <h2 class="gh-landing-voices-title" id="gh-landing-voices-title">{{t "What our community says"}}</h2>
        <div class="gh-landing-voices-list gh-carousel" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-labelledby="gh-landing-voices-title">
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>“…Entré por codicia y me quedé por placer y para aprender de esta hermosa comunidad que vale oro, o monero, jaja.”</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/aia1972/96/2578_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>AIA1972</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>“…Nunca me imaginé que iba a compartir y aprender sobre muchísimas temáticas…”</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/marcosgal/96/2453_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>marcosgal</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>“…Una vez que me metí en el mundo criptonauta, me di cuenta de que lo que quiero es libertad.”</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/el.luigi/96/6795_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>el.luigi</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>“…Cada peso pagado lo vale absolutamente. Se ve la dedicación en el libro, foro, Discord y todo en general.”</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/charly_hg1/96/2404_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>CHARLY_HG1</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>“Hace un par de meses pagué el acceso a tu libro y curso, encontrando muchísimo más de lo esperado.”</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://avatars.criptonautas.co/patch/96/ejdianti" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>ejdianti</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>“Qué genial es tener este foro y comunidad para no volverse loco con tanta información que hay por ahí…”</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/faze/96/1116_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>Faze</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>“…Se agradece el blog y el foro por su estilo respetuoso, de aprendizaje y aportación.”</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/cecilia_irene/96/704_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>Cecilia_Irene</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>“Elijo navegar por este sitio porque lo que se informa no es de un modo frenético…”</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://avatars.criptonautas.co/patch/96/PabloIg" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>PabloIg</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>“Quiero agradecer sobre todo la responsabilidad y seriedad con la que se maneja toda la comunidad.”</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/nachoeguia/96/1445_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>nachoeguia</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>“…Me ha parecido difícil encontrar personas en mi círculo social que se encuentren en el universo cripto, por eso valoro mucho la comunidad.”</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://avatars.criptonautas.co/patch/96/Mjhernandez" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>Mjhernandez</strong></figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="gh-landing-voice"><blockquote>“…La comunidad es fundamental para no estar aislado y apoyarnos unos a otros.”</blockquote><figcaption><img class="gh-landing-voice-avatar" src="https://comunidad.criptonautas.co/user_avatar/comunidad.criptonautas.co/bilbonauta/96/3415_2.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"><strong>bilbonauta</strong></figcaption></figure>
